sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application Service
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant DB as Relational Database

    Note over App,DB: 1. Cache-Aside (Lazy Loading) - Read Flow
    App->>Cache: GET user:1001
    alt Cache Hit (Key found)
        Cache-->>App: Return User Data (Fast, <1ms)
    else Cache Miss (Key not found)
        Cache-->>App: Return Nil
        App->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = 1001
        DB-->>App: Return User Row
        App->>Cache: SETEX user:1001 3600 <UserData>
        App-->>App: Process User Data
    end

    Note over App,DB: 2. Write Flow (Cache Invalidation)
    App->>DB: UPDATE users SET name = 'New Name' WHERE id = 1001
    DB-->>App: Update Success
    App->>Cache: DEL user:1001 (Invalidate cache to avoid stale read)
